@startuml
actor "Ingeniero QA" as QA
boundary "GherkinScenariosView" as Vista
control "GherkinController.create" as Controller
control "GherkinService" as Service
entity "GherkinScenario" as Scenario
entity "UseCase" as UseCase
entity "FunctionalRequirement" as RF
entity "Session" as Session
database "MongoDB\n(gherkinscenarios)" as BD

QA -> Vista : Introducir título, feature,\nucId, rfIds y pasos Given/When/Then
Vista -> Controller : POST /api/scenarios
Controller -> Service : createScenario(body, userId)
Service -> Session : assertManualSession(sessionId)
Session --> Service : sesión válida
Service -> UseCase : validar ucId
UseCase --> Service : ucId existente
Service -> RF : validar rfIds
RF --> Service : requisitos existentes
Service -> Scenario : crear escenario Gherkin
Scenario -> BD : GherkinScenario.create()
BD --> Service : escenario creado
Service --> Controller : resultado OK
Controller --> Vista : respuesta OK
Vista --> QA : Escenario Gherkin registrado
@enduml